        "slc_8835d24b8c768678cf15e0f6b895eebaf35477f1e65ebcd124d6fb29202feeea"
      ],
      "text": "The server exposes WebSocket routes (/api/event/ws, /api/global/event/ws, /api/terminal/ws) and SSE routes (/api/event, /api/global/event, /api/notifications/stream, /api/openchamber/events) that reverse proxies must pass through unbuffered."
    },
