        "slc_4e9e2e0ef0378fc9731c52e465729c1bf4cc80ecd1e9766483d882e56a05b17e"
      ],
      "text": "Session Goals let a user set a finish line; the system checks results after each turn and keeps the agent working until the goal completes, the agent is blocked, or a user-set limit is reached, continuing even after the app is closed."
    },
