        "slc_ca2304374dbaa5403f66a19f2ba86651db8f5d430597a0469173d7d118929741"
      ],
      "text": "Multi-run assigns the same task to up to five models in separate sessions with optional worktrees, and Fusion can combine the strongest parts of those runs into a new session."
